## Special Style: Yellow Diamond Radiant Cut Wedding Rings

Yellow diamonds are a distinct category within radiant cut wedding rings. The radiant cut shape was originally developed for colored diamonds because its facet pattern maximizes color saturation. A yellow radiant cut shows more vivid color than the same stone in a round brilliant or princess cut.

These are not everyday white-diamond wedding bands. They are statement pieces for buyers who want a warm, dramatic look — or for those pairing with a yellow diamond engagement ring.

