## The Bezel Option: Smooth Surface, Maximum Protection

The bezel-set wedding band encases each stone in a continuous metal rim. For buyers who are active or work with their hands, the bezel eliminates every snagging risk that comes with prong-set stones.

The tradeoff is the same as with any bezel setting: less light enters the stone from the sides, so brilliance is softer than in a prong setting. The trade is worth it for daily-wear buyers.

Bezel radiant wedding bands use natural diamonds at 3ct total weight. All three metal options are priced within $585 of each other.

